# Dev Notes 26 — Worker Layout Option C Lifecycle Services v1

## Date

2026-06-07

## Branch

```text
worker-layout-option-c-lifecycle-services-v1
```

## Purpose

This branch continues Worker Layout Option C by extracting worker lifecycle helpers from `llama_worker/llama.mjs` while keeping `llama_worker/llama.mjs` as the stable worker entrypoint and composition root.

The extraction is intentionally narrow:

- model lifecycle service;
- reset lifecycle service;
- shutdown lifecycle service.

## Source base

Implementation was staged from a refreshed working tree reconstructed from:

```text
GitHub modularization direct raw/source inspection
/mnt/data/runtime-dev-repo-modularization.zip as a stale formatted mirror
```

Active source truth remains GitHub branch:

```text
https://github.com/Main-Michael-Sparks/runtime-dev-repo/tree/modularization
```

The local formatted mirror was stale at the start of this branch: it stopped at `docs/dev-notes.24` and did not include the completed `worker-layout-option-c-context-session-v1` files. The staged branch therefore first preserved the completed context/session extraction shape before applying this lifecycle extraction.

## Explicit non-goals preserved

This branch does not include:

- prompt runner extraction;
- worker protocol router extraction;
- parent runtime changes;
- worker protocol redesign;
- model path/model identity behavior changes;
- configOverride surface changes;
- prompt/output semantic changes;
- cleanup or optimization outside the narrow extraction;
- child-process/native containment redesign.

