## Review notes

Lifecycle extraction was deliberately staged after context/session extraction because the formatted mirror was stale. The staged `llama_worker/llama.mjs` preserves context/session service wiring from `worker-layout-option-c-context-session-v1` and only moves lifecycle helpers for this branch.

Copy-completeness focus points checked:

- `disposeModelStack()` moved into `modelLifecycle.mjs` and remains wired back into reset/shutdown lifecycle;
- `initModel()` moved into `modelLifecycle.mjs` and remains called by the inline router on `init` messages;
- `assertWorkerReadyForNativeCommand()` moved into `modelLifecycle.mjs` and remains called before reset/session/prompt operations;
- reset/shutdown operation labels remain distinct;
- prompt-runner final cleanup ownership was not moved.

## Caveats / known risks

```text
Finding:
  Lifecycle extraction moves init/dispose/reset/shutdown behavior that controls model readiness, operation-aware disposal, and active request boundary waits.
Affected surface:
  assertWorkerReadyForNativeCommand, setActiveInitConfig, resetActiveInitConfig, disposeModelStack, initModel, resetModel, shutdownWorker.
Why it matters:
  Small ordering drift could change ready/error metadata, collapse reset/shutdown disposal semantics, dispose while active requests are still settling, or lose active init config/profile metadata.
Smallest safe correction:
  Keep model lifecycle as a dependency-injected service, keep reset/shutdown lifecycle separate, preserve operation-aware disposeModelStack calls, and leave router/prompt cleanup ownership inline.
What still needs verification:
  Michael real-runtime lifecycle/context carry-forward gates before merge readiness.
```

```text
Finding:
  This branch was staged from a stale formatted mirror that lacked the completed context/session files.
Affected surface:
  Source-truth handling and patch interpretation.
Why it matters:
  A patch generated against the stale mirror would incorrectly include prior context/session extraction as if it belonged to this branch.
Smallest safe correction:
  Treat GitHub modularization as source truth; treat staged full files as candidate replacement files; compare lifecycle delta against direct GitHub/source state before applying.
What still needs verification:
  Direct GitHub source inspection after Michael uploads/applies the branch.
```

